{"entries":[{"id":"tsk-pro-24-1","title":"Proverbs 24:1","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":1,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":1},"content":"<p>19; 3:31; 23:17; Ps 37:1,7; 73:3; Ga 5:19-21; Jas 4:5,6 neither. 1:11-15; 13:20; Ge 13:10-13; 19:1-11; Ps 26:9</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-2","title":"Proverbs 24:2","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":2,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":2},"content":"<p>8; 6:14; 1Sa 23:9; Es 3:6,7; Job 15:35; Ps 7:14; 10:7; 28:3; 36:4 Ps 64:4-6; 140:2; Isa 59:4; Mic 7:3; Mt 26:3,4; Lu 23:20,21 Ac 13:10</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-3","title":"Proverbs 24:3","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":3,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":3},"content":"<p>wisdom. 9:1; 14:1; 1Co 3:9 it is. 2Sa 7:26; Jer 10:12; Col 2:7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-4","title":"Proverbs 24:4","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":4,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":4},"content":"<p>15:6; 20:15; 21:20; 27:23-27; 1Ki 4:22-28; 1Ch 27:25-31; 29:2-9 2Ch 4:18-22; 26:4-11; Ne 10:39; 13:5-13; Mt 13:52</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-5","title":"Proverbs 24:5","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":5,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":5},"content":"<p>A wise. 8:14; 10:29; 21:22; Ec 7:19; 9:14-18 strong. Heb. in strength. increaseth strength. Heb.strengtheneth might. Ps 84:7; Isa 40:31; Col 1:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-6","title":"Proverbs 24:6","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":6,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":6},"content":"<p>by. 20:18; Lu 14:31; 1Co 9:25-27; Eph 6:10-20; 1Ti 6:11,12; 2Ti 4:7 and. 11:14; 15:22</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-7","title":"Proverbs 24:7","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":7,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":7},"content":"<p>too. 14:6; 15:24; 17:24; Ps 10:5; 92:5,6; 1Co 2:14 openeth. 22:22; 31:8,9; Job 29:7-25; 31:21; Isa 29:21; Am 5:10,12,15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-8","title":"Proverbs 24:8","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":8,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":8},"content":"<p>2,9; 6:14,18; 14:22; 1Ki 2:44; Ps 21:11; Isa 10:7-13; 32:7 Eze 38:10,11; Na 1:11; Ro 1:30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-9","title":"Proverbs 24:9","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":9,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":9},"content":"<p>thought. 8; 23:7; Ge 6:5; 8:21; Ps 119:113; Isa 55:7; Jer 4:14; Mt 5:28; 9:4 Mt 15:19; Ac 8:22; 2Co 10:5 the scorner. 22:10; 29:8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-10","title":"Proverbs 24:10","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":10,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":10},"content":"<p>thou. 1Sa 27:1; Job 4:5; Isa 40:28-31; Joh 4:8; 2Co 4:1; Eph 3:13 Heb 12:3-5; Re 2:3,13 small. Heb. narrow.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-11","title":"Proverbs 24:11","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":11,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":11},"content":"<p>1Sa 26:8,9; Job 29:17; Ps 82:4; Isa 58:6,7; Lu 10:31,32; 23:23-25 Ac 18:17; 21:31,32; 23:10,23-35; 1Jo 3:16,17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-12","title":"Proverbs 24:12","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":12,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":12},"content":"<p>doth not he that. 5:21; 21:2; 1Sa 16:7; Ps 7:9; 17:3; 44:21; Ec 5:8; Jer 17:10; Ro 2:16 1Co 4:5; Heb 4:12,13; Re 2:18,23 that keepeth. 1Sa 2:6; 25:29; Ps 66:9; 121:3,8; Da 5:23; Ac 17:28; Re 1:18 and shall. Job 34:11; Ps 62:12; Jer 32:19; Mt 16:27; Ro 2:6; 2Co 5:10; Re 2:23 Re 20:12-15; 22:12</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-13","title":"Proverbs 24:13","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":13,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":13},"content":"<p>eat. 25:16,27; So 5:1; Isa 7:15; Mt 3:4 to thy taste. Heb. upon thy palate.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-14","title":"Proverbs 24:14","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":14,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":14},"content":"<p>shall the. 22:18; Ps 19:10,11; 119:103,111; Jer 15:16 when. 2:1-5,10; 3:13-18 there. 23:18; Mt 19:21; Jas 1:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-15","title":"Proverbs 24:15","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":15,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":15},"content":"<p>Lay. 1:11; 1Sa 9:11; 22:18,19; 23:20-23; Ps 10:8-10; 37:32; 56:6; 59:3 Ps 140:5; Jer 11:19; Mt 26:4; Ac 9:24; 23:16; 25:3 spoil. 22:28; Isa 32:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-16","title":"Proverbs 24:16","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":16,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":16},"content":"<p>a just. Job 5:19; Ps 34:19; 37:24; Mic 7:8-10; 2Co 1:8-10; 4:8-12; 11:23-27 but. 13:17; 28:14-18; 1Sa 26:10; 31:4; Es 7:10; Ps 7:16; 52:5; Am 5:2 Am 8:14; Ac 12:23; 1Th 5:3; Re 18:20,21</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-17","title":"Proverbs 24:17","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":17,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":17},"content":"<p>17:5; Jud 16:25; 2Sa 16:5-14; Job 31:29; Ps 35:15,19; 42:10; Ob 1:12 1Co 13:6,7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-18","title":"Proverbs 24:18","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":18,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":18},"content":"<p>displease him. Heb. be evil in his eyes. and he. La 4:21,22; Zec 1:15,16</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-19","title":"Proverbs 24:19","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":19,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":19},"content":"<p>Fret.or, Keep not company with the wicked.</p>\n<p>13:20; Nu 16:26; Ps 1:1; 26:4,5; 119:115; 2Co 6:17; Eph 5:11 2Ti 3:2-5; Re 18:4 neither. 1; 23:17; Ps 37:1; 73:3</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-20","title":"Proverbs 24:20","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":20,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":20},"content":"<p>there. Ps 9:17; 11:6; Isa 3:11 candle. or, lamp. 13:9; 20:20; Job 18:5,6; 21:17; Mt 8:12; 25:8; Jude 1:13</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-21","title":"Proverbs 24:21","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":21,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":21},"content":"<p>fear. Ex 14:31; 1Sa 24:6; Ec 8:2-5; Mt 22:21; Ro 13:1-7; Tit 3:1 1Pe 2:13-17 meddle. Nu 16:1-3; 1Sa 8:5-7; 12:12-19; 2Sa 15:13-37; 1Ki 12:16 given to change. Heb. changers.</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-22","title":"Proverbs 24:22","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":22,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":22},"content":"<p>their. Nu 16:31-35; 1Sa 31:1-7; 2Sa 18:7,8; 2Ch 13:16,17; Ho 5:11 Ho 13:10,11 who. 16:14; 20:2; Ps 90:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-23","title":"Proverbs 24:23","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":23,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":23},"content":"<p>things. Ps 107:43; Ec 8:1-5; Ho 14:9; Jas 3:17 It. 18:5; 28:21; Le 19:15; De 1:17; 16:19; 2Ch 19:7; Ps 82:2-4; Joh 7:24 1Ti 5:20,21; Jas 2:4-6; 1Pe 1:17</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-24","title":"Proverbs 24:24","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":24,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":24},"content":"<p>that. 17:15; Ex 23:6,7; Isa 5:20,23; Jer 6:13,14; 8:10,11; Eze 13:22 him shall. 11:26; 28:27; 30:10; Isa 66:24</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-25","title":"Proverbs 24:25","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":25,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":25},"content":"<p>them. Le 19:17; 1Sa 3:13; 1Ki 21:19,20; Ne 5:7-9; 13:8-11,17,25,28 Job 29:16-18; Mt 14:4; 1Ti 5:20; 2Ti 4:2; Tit 1:13; 2:15 a good blessing. Heb. a blessing of good. 28:23</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-26","title":"Proverbs 24:26","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":26,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":26},"content":"<p>shall. 15:23; 16:1; 25:11,12; Ge 41:38-57; Da 2:46-48; Mr 12:17,18,32-34 giveth a right answer. Heb. answereth right words. Job 6:25</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-27","title":"Proverbs 24:27","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":27,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":27},"content":"<p>1Ki 5:17,18; 6:7; Lu 14:28-30</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-28","title":"Proverbs 24:28","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":28,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":28},"content":"<p>not. 14:5; 19:5,9; 21:28; Ex 20:16; 23:1; 1Sa 22:9,10; 1Ki 21:9-13 Job 2:3; Ps 35:7,11; 52:1; *title Mt 26:59,60; 27:23; Joh 15:25 deceive. Eph 4:25; Col 3:9; Re 21:8; 22:15</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-29","title":"Proverbs 24:29","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":29,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":29},"content":"<p>Say. 20:22; 25:21,22; Mt 5:39-44; Ro 12:17-21; 1Th 5:15 I will do. Jud 15:11; 2Sa 13:22-28</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-30","title":"Proverbs 24:30","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":30,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":30},"content":"<p>went. 6:6-19; Job 4:8; 5:27; 15:17; Ps 37:25; 107:42; Ec 4:1-8; 7:15 Ec 8:9-11 void. 10:13; 12:11</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-31","title":"Proverbs 24:31","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":31,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":31},"content":"<p>it. Ge 3:17-19; Job 31:40; Jer 4:3; Mt 13:7,22; Heb 6:8 and the. 19:23; 20:4; 22:13; 23:21; Ec 10:18</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-32","title":"Proverbs 24:32","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":32,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":32},"content":"<p>considered it. Heb. set my heart. Job 7:17; Ps 4:4; Lu 2:19,51 I looked. De 13:11; 21:21; 32:29; 1Co 10:6,11; Jude 1:5-7</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-33","title":"Proverbs 24:33","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":33,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":33},"content":"<p>6:4-11; Ro 13:11; Eph 5:14; 1Th 5:6-8</p>"},{"id":"tsk-pro-24-34","title":"Proverbs 24:34","author":"R. A. Torrey (editor)","reference":{"book":"PRO","chapterStart":24,"verseStart":34,"chapterEnd":24,"verseEnd":34},"content":"<p>thy poverty. 10:4; 13:4 armed man. Heb. a man of shield.</p>"}]}